      "text": "Type: community_guide\nSource: WFPedia\nURL: https://www.wfpedia.com/\nDescription: The Ultimate Warframe Guides\nContenu: WFPedia Skip to content WFPedia Search K Main Navigation Home Guide Collection About Changelog Contact Us Privacy Policy Appearance Back to top WFPedia Guides & More The Ultimate Warframe Guides Archive Explore Join us 10+ Active Guides JOIN US 50k+ Community Members JOIN US 8+ Affiliated Servers JOIN US 10+ Guide Authors JOIN US Recommended Endo Guide RECOMMENDED @Mebius & Warframe Endo Staff One of the most consistent way of earning platinum in Warframe. Learn how to farm endo efficiently. Arbitrations Guide RECOMMENDED @Geek Check out our comprehensive guide and learn about the most efficient way to farm Vitus Essence. Profit-Taker Guide RECOMMENDED BOSS @uumm, Mebius, Iterniam, Kalaay Check out our comprehensive guide and learn about the most efficient way to farm Profit-Taker. Boss Guides Eidolon Guide BOSS @BAN, Lithiu, & Fenomeral A full eidolon hunting guide featuring everything including duo & speedrun strats. Credits Farming Guides Solo Index Guide RESOURCE @Mebius & YoRHaUmbra Acquiring credits in Warframe is vital for mod upgrades, and the Index offers a low-effort option for solo players. Other Guides Disruption Guide ENDGAME @Kaelith2035 & BAN A guide that will teach you how to speedrun disruption missions. Farm Guide NPF RESOURCE @BAN Farm Nanospore, Polymer, and Ferrite in the most efficient way possible. Stela Farming Guide RESOURCE @Tito A short guide diving into the basics of Stela farming and utilizing methods to generate as much as possible. Archive Unfortunately due to recent Warframe updates, the following guides have been archived as the methods showcased have been patched/nerfed. Secura Lecta Credits Guide ARCHIVED RESOURCE @Keymapper, BaroKachow & more! The most consistent and profitable way of farming credits in Warframe. Learn how to farm credits efficiently now! Aya Farming Guide ARCHIVED RESOURCE @Mebius, skinnix Aya is the best place for farming relics in Warframe, and our guide reveals how to maximize your gains effortlessly. ☕︎ Powered by VitePress, sugarat/theme Copyright © 2024-present, WFPedia",
