      "name": "WFPedia Changelog ​",
      "text": "Type: community_guide\nSource: WFPedia\nURL: https://www.wfpedia.com/posts/site/update-log\nDescription: This is the update log of WFPedia\nContenu: WFPedia Changelog | WFPedia Skip to content WFPedia Search K Main Navigation Home Guide Collection About Changelog Contact Us Privacy Policy Appearance Table of Contents Back to top Sidebar Navigation 🔍 Related Articles 1 Contact Us 3 minutes ago 2 Privacy Policy 3 minutes ago 3 WFPedia Changelog 3 minutes ago Share this page Contents Farm Endo Warframe Endo Trade Endo Farm Aya Warframe Aya Trade Aya From credits Profit-Taker Comm. to speedruns Buy me a coffee Support the development https://ko-fi.com/meb154 WFPedia Changelog ​ INFO This is the update log of the website. 1.0.9 (October 15th, 2025) ​ Changes ​ Updated multiple Aya guide pages for improved clarity, author attribution, and up-to-date information. Added a new 'General Tips' procedure page, revised navigation in .vitepress config to include new and renamed sections, and updated video links and descriptions for all roles. Adjusted metadata and formatting in related resource guides and changelog for consistency. 1.0.8 (October 6th, 2025) ​ Changes ​ Secura Lecta Guide Fixes (v1.0.1): Fixed multiple wording issues and formatting. 1.0.7 (October 5th, 2025) ​ Changes ​ Added Secura Lecta Credits Farming Guide 1.0.6 (May 31st, 2025) ​ Changes ​ Updated The Ultimate Endo Farming Guide Updated Nekros procedure section 1.0.5 (May 2nd, 2025) ​ Changes ​ Updated The Ultimate Endo Farming Guide Updated Khora Build section to better reflect current standards Changed some builds/explanations 1.0.4 (January 26th, 2025) ​ Changes ​ Updated The Ultimate Aya Farming Guide Changed builds to match with the ones shown in the Discord server Added proper procedure for every role Added many videos and gifs for better explanation 1.0.3 (November 20th, 2024) ​ Changes ​ Updated The Ultimate Endo Farming Guide Fixed minor mistakes in Nekros and Ripkas build descriptions Changed wording in Nidus run procedure Optimized web resource usage 1.0.2 (November 9th, 2024) ​ Changes ​ Updated The Ultimate Endo Farming Guide Made everything less complicated Extended Nidus Procedure section Added new subdomains: https://endo.wfpedia.com/ https://aya.wfpedia.com/ https://eidolon.wfpedia.com/ Minor fixes Improved web performance and caching logic 1.0.1 (October 26th, 2024) ​ Changes ​ Updated The Ultimate Endo Farming Guide Added The Ultimate Index Guide (incomplete) Added The Ultimate Aya Farming Guide Fixed router rewrites and dymamic routings Fixed Home Page links Optimized file size and caching 1.0.0 (October 10th, 2024) ​ Changes ​ Initial Release ☕︎ Powered by VitePress, sugarat/theme Copyright © 2024-present, WFPedia",
